Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样\N- 小悠 感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吉田
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,麒麟的姐姐 身材好 长得也漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我引以为傲的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然会和这样的姐姐在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那就不介绍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,新井惠子和她的女儿丽玛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 悠太君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看 丽玛在打招呼了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来打个招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是 初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打算结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,突然多了个兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说你们这个年纪可能觉得像朋友一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.78,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但以后就是一家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大家要和睦相处哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩好好相处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.73,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不容易找到合适的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢甜的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 她回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听说有个阿姨出了车祸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在在医院
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸出差了 可能要过一阵子才回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他说让我们先两个人生活一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,阿姨没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好像没有生命危险
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,只是需要静养一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈说她得照顾我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.91,0:03:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.78,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊你在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我都快想一个人生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我在找工作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在家里总不能一直白吃白喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以想找份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有合适的吗\N- 啊没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我去换衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,男性的按摩店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但地球也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要试试看一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.89,0:04:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 力度合适吗\N- 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的肩膀挺僵硬的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是经常对着电脑工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.94,0:04:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以你整天对着电脑\N- 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真辛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才会这么紧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐你在干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 悠太回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你进来的时候应该敲门的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,说的是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,决定去男式按摩店工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,下周就开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没去过那种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想先练习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊\N- 男式按摩店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是成人娱乐场所吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有点这样的成分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但我工作的是一家正规的店
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有空吧\N- 当练习费也行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我这么要求的也就只有悠太了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:05:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果用我 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以开始了\N- 啊哦 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个要用到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,按摩油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,先从上半身开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这是什么反应\N- 请
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个有点不习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没体验过这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没体验过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别逗我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 因为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是面对面的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不看反应不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不要看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这样会尴尬的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我闭着眼睛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这样怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是舒服还是不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 有点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是舒服吗\N- 我觉得这是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:07:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,想要更强一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再强一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 印度\N- 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉像是在做按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦~
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有品味
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么\N- 不 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里\N- 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么地方\N- 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊 命中注定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,再忍一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊\N- 上面写着要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,上面写着必须要认真做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经很努力在忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这是单位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,停止 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我也在忍着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,忍着比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再忍一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样发力感觉有点难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那边也可以插进来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 怎么样\N- 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的声音是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才和现在比呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才和现在比
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有点直接刺激到那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,刺激的感觉 就像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这样的话 是不是比刚才好一些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 嗯\N- 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么办呢\N- 唉 完全没参考价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再说清楚一点 不然我听不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经说得很清楚了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那你觉得舒服还是不舒服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 舒服\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果舒服的话就继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,按摩其实挺难的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那个声音能停下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢那种声音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,自己控制不住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那客人都是这种感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上面也是这样吗\N- 是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要去按摩脚了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.77,0:12:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不重吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果觉得重就说出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不 太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.09,0:12:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,即使夸奖也没有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我没夸你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 真的好舒服好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没有夸你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:12:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,说话方式
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.35,0:13:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,脚要怎么放才好呢好难
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 脚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉会把体重压到肚子上 有点害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,担心会把体重压到肚子上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力一点可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.13,0:13:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么做才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再用力一点好吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是什么模棱两可的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再用力一点可以吗\N- 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨哟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要换另一边做吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 感觉挺舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个尺寸合适吗\N- 这是什么东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才还做了什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.42,0:15:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我马上想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,苏庆部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,苏庆部苏庆部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不知道吗\N- 不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为大家都知道章鱼人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,脚根部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,脚根啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨哟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这个要做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,用毛巾擦一下可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨哟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把腿分开一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拿这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊还要插进去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的话就做不了按摩了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,姿势有点奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 还是说那个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.52,0:16:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:16:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好像有点露出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 等等 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再大一点的尺寸有没有呢这个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,先试试软管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 有点不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不看了 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,手 手……对 放松点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不看了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会有这种反应
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是刑部啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听说这里特别舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还能做点别的\N- 不能做别的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,已经做了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 现在都出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在都出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 真的出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,出来了 出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你已经做了\N- 看 都已经这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还是穿普通的内裤比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.51,0:19:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以不穿这个吗\N- 如果弄脏了会很麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想和你一起洗衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,油都沾上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 我也忍着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果疼就告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再加点油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:19:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还要更多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,多一点会更滑 感觉更好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你真坏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样写的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我没碰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没碰 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.18,0:20:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这样刚刚好\N- 实在不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,实在不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是成人店吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.65,0:20:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是哪边的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样拍下来写好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才开始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,都快出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.76,0:21:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.78,0:21:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会有奇怪的动作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊 没有动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在动哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,手挡着没法按摩了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.68,0:22:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.60,0:23:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,手淫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不用做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,做一下也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.98,0:23:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对要做
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,练习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是今天没有安排啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这样 但我觉得还是要做
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么突然这么急\N- 不是 是盐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.56,0:23:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,做一下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.27,0:23:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 你做这种工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.63,0:23:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,练习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.72,0:23:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.69,0:24:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这样可以吗\N- 可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.64,0:24:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为不脱衣服不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.88,0:24:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,脱衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.34,0:24:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.74,0:24:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,认真做哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,张开嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,做完收工
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.80,0:24:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 我换个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.61,0:24:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 弟弟的那边不想看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.33,0:24:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.17,0:24:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 不是叹气哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.62,0:24:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.60,0:24:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真的只一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.65,0:24:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.85,0:24:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.44,0:25:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,做的时候那个声音忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行吗\N- 自己看也没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那边危险
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.54,0:25:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才说那里危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.85,0:25:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.42,0:25:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.62,0:25:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样说是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.54,0:25:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.28,0:25:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不要说“啊” 应该说“危险”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.10,0:25:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,危险的地方就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.52,0:25:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.32,0:25:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这不行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.19,0:25:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.29,0:26:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的这么好吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.60,0:26:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吗\N- 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.29,0:26:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不尴尬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.19,0:26:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.10,0:26:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.50,0:26:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我毕竟是姐姐 但真的太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.91,0:26:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.09,0:26:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.41,0:26:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.26,0:26:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.81,0:26:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是在店里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.83,0:26:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能一直这样了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 就像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.61,0:27:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.44,0:27:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要快一点之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.24,0:27:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.16,0:27:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.74,0:27:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.54,0:27:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,按摩的话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.61,0:27:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是更多是男人来做
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.82,0:27:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 是吗\N- 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.42,0:27:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的男人来做的话 经常能看到
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.32,0:27:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.70,0:27:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真柔软
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.70,0:27:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.45,0:27:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 两只手很难
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.76,0:27:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.84,0:27:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.13,0:28:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 终于到这个房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.82,0:28:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.44,0:29:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 可能有点危险
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.28,0:29:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.00,0:29:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太危险了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.74,0:29:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道吧
