Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.30,0:29:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 真的不行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.66,0:29:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 稍等一下\N- 要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.14,0:29:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.22,0:29:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别出来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.33,0:29:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.28,0:30:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.88,0:30:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.49,0:30:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起我这边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.60,0:30:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.33,0:30:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.09,0:31:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.70,0:31:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.15,0:31:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再练习一次可以吗\N- 回去可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.46,0:31:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.29,0:31:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.52,0:31:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.40,0:31:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话看不见脸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.00,0:31:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.98,0:31:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,说点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.80,0:32:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.14,0:32:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.65,0:32:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.58,0:32:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,开始工作后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不说话会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.06,0:32:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.86,0:32:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,抬腿
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.43,0:32:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.13,0:32:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.61,0:32:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话看不见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.24,0:33:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,应该会很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.57,0:33:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说应该是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.04,0:33:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.50,0:33:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 果然没有屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.03,0:33:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.98,0:34:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很重\N- 是的是的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.64,0:34:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.78,0:34:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.22,0:34:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那么下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.94,0:34:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要做骨盆前倾的动作哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.02,0:34:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以让我四脚着地吗\N- 啊四脚着地
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.98,0:34:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.24,0:34:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.05,0:34:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不会不好意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.82,0:34:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.54,0:34:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,写的是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.58,0:35:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,四脚着地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.88,0:35:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四脚着地 就是这里对吗\N- 对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.68,0:35:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,再把腿张开一点
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.08,0:35:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊\N- 就是这样就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.18,0:35:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊\N- 可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.02,0:35:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也看不见的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.70,0:35:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗\N- 真的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.12,0:35:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不会痛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.72,0:35:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.67,0:36:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不想看 但有点不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.86,0:36:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.92,0:36:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 现在我只能看到你的背
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.54,0:36:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的装扮不会不好意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.96,0:36:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.94,0:36:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也觉得有点尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.65,0:36:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.19,0:37:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好帅
