Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.28,0:38:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.94,0:38:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.06,0:38:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这边的脚 这样可以抬起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.64,0:38:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 抬起来的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.82,0:38:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起膝盖
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.32,0:38:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.86,0:38:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.76,0:38:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.16,0:38:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.50,0:38:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.16,0:38:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 这更害羞了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.28,0:38:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.24,0:38:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.34,0:38:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.41,0:38:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.14,0:38:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样做起来更容易
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.33,0:39:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,又变硬了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.32,0:39:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.37,0:39:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是按摩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.08,0:39:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.76,0:40:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一碰就变硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.03,0:40:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是这样的吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.52,0:40:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.49,0:40:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.51,0:40:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太热了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.03,0:40:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是成人娱乐场所吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.23,0:40:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.72,0:41:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这是什么声音\N- 因为变硬了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.48,0:42:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.33,0:42:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
