Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.62,0:43:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.10,0:43:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.69,0:43:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要再配合一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.96,0:43:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来很爽的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:43:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.02,0:44:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,停停
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.20,0:44:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.60,0:44:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是早就该说停了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.68,0:44:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不是早就该说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.00,0:44:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还更差了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.88,0:44:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我弱
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.20,0:44:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢的不只是那里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.84,0:44:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.08,0:45:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.48,0:45:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一下子就硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.81,0:45:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 今天好热啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.12,0:46:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢
