Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.48,0:52:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起你的臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.12,0:52:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.38,0:52:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.93,0:52:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.99,0:52:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.09,0:53:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.82,0:53:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好厉害的时间点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.62,0:53:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.85,0:53:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
