Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.78,0:53:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,说了也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.18,0:53:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐真的很漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.70,0:53:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别说不好意思的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.86,0:53:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想试试这个
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.40,0:53:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.48,0:54:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.37,0:54:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次做 不知道能不能做好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.90,0:54:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.28,0:54:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.52,0:54:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.93,0:54:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这么激烈有点危险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.40,0:54:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,环境很重要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.12,0:54:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,越快越危险
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.00,0:55:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.66,0:55:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.42,0:56:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,呼~
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.16,0:56:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,想舔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.82,0:56:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.94,0:56:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,呼~
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.42,0:56:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.42,0:56:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 薄暮的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.38,0:57:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.00,0:58:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀有点危险
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.89,0:58:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有点危险
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.66,0:58:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 等等 亲一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.30,0:58:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.66,0:58:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点讨厌你哦
