Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.97,1:00:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话 两边都舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.81,1:00:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.74,1:01:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.18,1:01:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.90,1:02:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,睡着了
