Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.96,1:47:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.32,1:47:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都看得一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.94,1:47:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有阻碍
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.30,1:47:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.28,1:48:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.80,1:48:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.62,1:49:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.20,1:49:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可以再做吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.62,1:50:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.10,1:51:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,也许会出来
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.56,1:51:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以多做点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.32,1:51:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.26,1:51:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.36,1:51:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 这个 乳头痛的创伤也一起好了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.70,1:51:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下 我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.44,1:52:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起做吗
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.66,1:52:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.92,1:53:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你吐的时候我看了很多
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.92,1:53:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.82,1:53:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,已经
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.62,1:53:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不停啊
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.82,1:53:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了 要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.90,1:54:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.72,1:54:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,击中了很多地方
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.68,1:54:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.94,1:55:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,开始有点失控了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.26,1:55:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.08,1:55:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在可以继续享受
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.21,1:55:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 你一直都很享受
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.61,1:55:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都沾满了油 要不现在去洗澡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.67,1:56:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个真舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.81,1:56:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.46,1:56:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,耳根都红了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.22,1:57:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,机制也取下来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.00,1:57:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.27,1:57:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是我 妈妈也很享受哦
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.44,1:58:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,又变大了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.40,1:58:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还要涂到嘴巴里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.02,1:59:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚射出来的地方又恢复了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.82,1:59:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我做得好吗\N- 啊琪
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.42,1:59:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.86,1:59:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有点危险呢
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.16,1:59:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快要忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.70,1:59:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的要来吗\N- 不行不行
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.72,1:59:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,想要来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.78,2:00:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.64,2:00:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,向这边看过来
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.66,2:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也要好好洗哦
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.54,2:01:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.38,2:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,客人会喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.94,2:01:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,因为舒服所以客人应该会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.36,2:02:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要冲掉呢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.19,2:02:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你冲掉吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.88,2:02:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有掉下来吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.98,2:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样像热水一样温暖吗
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.86,2:02:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.86,2:03:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是成人娱乐场所哦
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.10,2:03:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 挺好的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.20,2:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,又变大了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.98,2:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢的话 我们再来享受一下吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.22,2:04:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.19,2:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,舔你的蛋蛋感觉好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.16,2:04:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.42,2:05:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.02,2:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这边的感觉更好哦
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.26,2:05:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,口里
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.34,2:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才更硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.18,2:06:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.26,2:06:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,出来了...快出来了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.72,2:06:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯\N- 啊啊啊啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.20,2:06:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,呼...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.96,2:06:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.44,2:07:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,乳房还在动呢
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.59,2:07:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,脚趾头被轻轻摩擦的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.64,2:08:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这个能夹住吗
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.93,2:08:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,夹得不太稳 但感觉挺舒服的
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.87,2:08:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.14,2:09:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我会好好摩擦的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.30,2:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,想要变得舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.38,2:09:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,想要
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.76,2:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样变得舒服也没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.16,2:10:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样真好
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.70,2:10:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.18,2:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.98,2:10:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.78,2:10:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.20,2:10:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.44,2:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊琪 啊琪 啊琪 啊琪
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.80,2:11:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,睡得很香呢
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.52,2:11:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 感觉舒服吗\N- 好的
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.80,2:11:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.98,2:11:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还有时间的话 我们再来享受一下吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.02,2:11:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐真的很认真哦
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.58,2:11:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.54,2:11:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在练习啊
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.02,2:11:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.70,2:12:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,明天姐姐就要开始打工了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.92,2:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 悠太
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.32,2:12:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小勇 起床啦
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.27,2:12:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,起来啦
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.44,2:12:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在干嘛呢姐姐
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.74,2:12:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.62,2:12:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.17,2:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,明天就要开始打工了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.75,2:12:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.24,2:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,担心你能不能应付过来
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.92,2:12:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,所以再练习一次吧
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.26,2:12:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再给我练习一下呗
Dialogue: 0,2:12:39.54,2:12:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在吗
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.70,2:13:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.30,2:14:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小勇最喜欢亲亲了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.86,2:14:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.98,2:14:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你很舒服的
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.68,2:15:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.26,2:15:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.13,2:15:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你都这么大了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.70,2:16:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你都这么大了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.44,2:16:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你都这么大了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.53,2:16:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了是不是很舒服\N- 你都这么大了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.65,2:16:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小勇都这么大了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.40,2:16:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小勇 你觉得舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.78,2:17:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小勇 你觉得舒服吗\N- 不用担心 什么都行
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.34,2:18:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小陈 你觉得舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:18:18.87,2:18:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
