Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.82,2:22:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,2:22:55.54,2:22:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好紧张好紧张
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.98,2:22:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.98,2:23:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请请请
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.98,2:23:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好紧张好紧张
