Dialogue: 0,2:29:24.60,2:29:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,说不行就不行
Dialogue: 0,2:29:34.40,2:29:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让我哭可以吗
Dialogue: 0,2:29:35.92,2:29:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,让我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,2:30:05.44,2:30:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:30:06.08,2:30:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊 太爽了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:08.44,2:30:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:30:17.20,2:30:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:30:39.34,2:30:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再打开一个
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.84,2:30:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:53.28,2:30:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:58.76,2:30:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.66,2:31:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:03.78,2:31:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:37.48,2:31:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.78,2:31:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:31:55.52,2:31:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:32:02.88,2:32:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快死的感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:32:48.06,2:32:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,2:32:52.82,2:32:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.08,2:33:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,意识到这个感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:33:11.06,2:33:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,工人师傅
Dialogue: 0,2:33:48.12,2:33:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,掉下来
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.40,2:33:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 太爽了
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.00,2:34:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,说的乱七八糟
